WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
This is 327. I'm going in.

00:30.000 --> 00:47.000
Hello. I was just admiring the art.

00:47.000 --> 01:04.000
Ericka, please. Such a lovely place you've got here. Is it usually this empty?

01:17.000 --> 01:30.000
Just a trim, please. Porous agent, Tratos.

02:17.000 --> 02:42.000
What are you doing?

02:42.000 --> 02:45.000
Chief, you got me. I need backup.

02:45.000 --> 02:53.000
What are you doing? No, I just wanted to hear you.

02:53.000 --> 02:57.000
Looks like we've found our next recruit.

02:57.000 --> 03:07.000
Carry on with the procedure. We have to make room for Agent 327.

03:27.000 --> 03:47.000
Thank you for watching.

